        "jsCode": "const isoString = $input.first().json.newDate;\nlet formatted = null;\n\nif (isoString) {\n  const date = new Date(isoString); // correctly interprets timezone offset\n\n  formatted = new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-US', {\n    timeZone: 'Asia/Karachi', // or change to your preferred zone if needed\n    month: '2-digit',\n    day: '2-digit',\n    year: 'numeric',\n    hour: '2-digit',\n    minute: '2-digit',\n    hour12: true\n  }).format(date);\n}\n\nreturn {\n  callback_time_formatted: formatted || 'Invalid or missing date'\n};\n"
      },
